  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catholic Diocese of Tombura Yambio Emergency preparedness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to develop the capacity of development &amp; peace office (the development wing of catholic diocese of Tombura-Yambio) to provide humanitarian response assistance to affected people by engaging on preparedness activities. The project is also thought to build on existing project already being implemented in the diocese to provide additional strength in order to be able to respond to the anticipated emergency situations in the country, including any scenarios that develop during the build up to the referendum and the aftermath of the Referenda and any other natural or man made disasters.  
The overall Objective is; To strengthen the capacity of the peace &amp; development office of diocese of Tombura-Yambio in preparedness to respond to humanitarian crisis that continued to affect the diocese. This intervention will focus on policy formulation, trainings, and provision of communication equipment. 
The expected results are; 3 policy documents will be produced one each in project implementation and administration, humanitarian intervention and procurement- logistic &amp;warehousing. 2 Radio HF codan installed and operational to support communication in 2 selected parishes.
The direct beneficiaries of the project will be the staff of development &amp; peace office of catholic diocese of Tombura-Yambio and those selected to attend consultative training workshop during formulation of the planned  policy guidelines.</narrative>
  </description>
